docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `PATCH /api/v1/groups/:groupID/cover` — Group owner or site admin; Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Checks access for a cover update. Cover upload is not implemented yet; this endpoint currently returns a success message without changing the cover.

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group ID. |

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {"success": true, "data": {"message": "group cover update is not implemented yet"}}
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_ID` — `groupID` is not a positive integer.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403 GROUP_FORBIDDEN` — Requester is neither the owner nor an admin.
  - `404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND` — Group does not exist or was deleted.
}
